     "gloss_en": "Elohim below (yarshi'un = two) and Elohim above: as below two, so above two; a court may not be even -- add one: five judges"
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_yarshiun_plural",
     "gloss_en": "yarshi'un is read as a plural: the verse's lower mention speaks of two judges"
